===Etymology 1===
From West {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{m|gem-pro|*trewwō}}. Cognate with {{cog|dum|trouwe}} ({{cog|nl|trouw}}), {{cog|osx|treuwa}}, {{cog|goh|triuwa}} ({{cog|de|Treue}}).

